        {
          "_comment": "Name and email arrive prefilled from the link. The site needs city, state, a 5-digit ZIP, and a date of birth or a street address. Street, city and state come from the matched record: C-S-S parses addressFull into the address and its extras.street. SpyDialer shows no DOB or ZIP anywhere, including the details page, so DOB stays empty and the ZIP is generated.",
